    <string name="privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_intro">No sign-in. No Sipan server. No ads.</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Your bookmarks, browser history and translation cache are stored on this device. On-device search does not send your query anywhere. Web search opens the public Brave Search page, so Brave receives your query like any website you visit. Sipan does not add Brave search results pages to its History list. If you add a page to the on-device index, an excerpt is saved locally.\n\nSipan only scans for translation after you tap Start. Google receives the text to translate. With on-device OCR, image pixels stay on your device. With optional Cloud Vision, Google also receives the image.\n\nPrivate tabs use isolated cookies, skip browsing history and translation disk caches, and delete their profiles when closed. Their address bar searches locally, but you can explicitly open web results. Private browsing does not hide requests from websites, your network or translation providers.</string>
    <string name="about">About Sipan</string>
    <string name="about_body">A browser for readers. Made to bring manga, manhwa, menus and the open web into your language.\n\nWeb engine: Android System WebView\nWeb search: Brave Search\nTranslation: Google Translate\nOn-device text recognition: Google ML Kit; PP-OCRv6 Tiny (Apache 2.0) / ONNX Runtime\nArabic-script font: Noto Naskh Arabic (SIL Open Font License)</string>
